Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:09.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The Team H show is about to begin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:11.66,Default,Member,0,0,60,,but before it starts, we, the Zenza Girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:13.26,Default,Member,0,0,60,,will perform one song for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Today, the three of us will perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.74,Default,Nagano Rara,0,0,60,,I'm Nagano Rara.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:21.56,Default,Yoshida Mei,0,0,60,,I'm Yoshida Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:24.88,Default,Matsunaga Yui,0,0,60,,I'm Matsunaga Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:28.92,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Now please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:31.68,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The Zenza Girls, with Miniskirt no Yosei.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:19.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Good evening, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.10,0:22:22.12,Default,Member,0,0,60,,We're HKT48 Team H!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.24,0:22:30.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The Team H Mokugekisha show has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:34.20,Default,Member,0,0,60,,First up: Mokugekisha, Zenjin Mitou, Ibitsu na Shinju,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.28,0:22:36.66,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and Akogare no Popstar — you heard four songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:41.15,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Is everyone having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.15,0:22:45.30,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.48,0:22:48.44,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Okay, from here we'd like to take today's commemorative photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:51.44,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Camera crew and fairy-san, please come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:52.30,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.48,0:23:03.62,Default,Member,0,0,60,,For today's pose... okay, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.20,0:23:07.88,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Then since it's Wednesday, a watery pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.09,0:23:25.07,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Then, Saa-chan, who stepped in on short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.15,0:23:25.87,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.19,0:23:30.17,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Since Shibu-chan is out sick today,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.25,0:23:32.65,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,something energetic, like Shibu-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.06,0:23:46.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,And finally, with Yuina-chan, who looks like she's zoning out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:50.46,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,Then, peace signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.92,0:23:52.68,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Peace, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.00,0:23:59.90,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.97,0:24:07.77,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Okay, the photo we just took will be on sale in the lobby after the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.76,0:24:13.28,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Everyone, please stop by as a memento of today's show.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.36,0:24:13.90,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Please do!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.62,0:24:22.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Now, from here, we'll each introduce ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.04,0:24:28.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Today's theme is: among the HKT48 members,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.34,0:24:33.38,Default,Member,0,0,60,,the member you think is your biggest rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.94,0:24:36.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Let's keep it peaceful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.66,0:24:39.22,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Let's start with Yuuna-chan, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.30,0:24:42.60,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,Hi, I'm HKT48 Team H's Yuuna, Yamauchi Yuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.68,0:24:44.24,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yuuna-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.42,0:24:47.18,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.46,0:24:52.26,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,For me, it's the young ones — or rather, um, Ikuno?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.70,0:24:54.42,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.62,0:24:58.36,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,Every time I see you, you've gotten taller, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.38,0:25:01.24,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,Me, I just don't grow anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.84,0:25:03.52,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Wait, isn't that not about being rivals?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:05.72,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,By the way, it's 165.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.88,0:25:06.16,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Whoa, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.44,0:25:10.62,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Did you grow again? Oh right, there's Reia-chan too, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.70,0:25:11.05,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.13,0:25:13.22,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,But side by side, you're about the same, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.30,0:25:13.84,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:15.16,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Number two in Team H.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.24,0:25:16.22,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.60,0:25:18.10,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.96,0:25:19.80,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,That's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.88,0:25:20.23,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,So cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.31,0:25:21.66,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,Maybe, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.74,0:25:23.80,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,since I might be standing near Ikuno today,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.88,0:25:25.56,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,I'll stretch up as tall as I can while dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.64,0:25:27.12,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,Please look after me all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.20,0:25:28.84,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.40,0:25:35.20,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Okay — the princess of the land of sleep: please wake Rino up! Wake me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.95,0:25:36.31,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.83,0:25:39.13,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,I'm Team H's Rino-chan, Sakamoto Rino!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.21,0:25:39.73,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Rino-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.69,0:25:41.05,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.61,0:25:48.30,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Thank you! The member I see as my biggest rival is Tanaka Iori-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.45,0:25:53.80,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,I have a proper reason — she doesn't really have much presence, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.29,0:25:58.93,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Is she really a rival? Remember — she said even automatic doors don't notice her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.40,0:26:01.84,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,So today, try a little harder, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.22,0:26:03.38,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,But let's stay friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.46,0:26:05.28,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Look after me — we're the same age!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.36,0:26:06.62,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Okaaay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.70,0:26:08.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I'll do my best today too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.40,0:26:15.70,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,I'm HKT48 Team H's Sae-chan, Kurihara Sae!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.82,0:26:17.18,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.04,0:26:23.20,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,The member I think is my rival
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.28,0:26:24.52,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,is Iori-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.60,0:26:25.26,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Huh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.52,0:26:26.16,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.34,0:26:27.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I get it, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.50,0:26:30.70,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Wow, if three people say it today, that's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.78,0:26:32.80,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Like, Iori-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.88,0:26:35.70,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,apparently in KIV she's the burikko character,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.34,0:26:37.24,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.32,0:26:37.98,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.06,0:26:39.44,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,like when she runs, she goes like this—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.08,0:26:41.20,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,She does, she does!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.28,0:26:43.62,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,— I heard that from Yuuna-chan today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.70,0:26:47.26,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,So I thought, I can't lose to her in cuteness,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.86,0:26:50.90,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,so like Iori-chan, I'll go full burikko—
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.18,0:26:53.50,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Team H's number-one burikko!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.42,0:26:56.98,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Yes, I'm going to go full burikko!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.06,0:26:58.74,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Please look after me today!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.30,0:27:04.28,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,When you say "angel-like little devil"—
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.36,0:27:08.71,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,I wanna be your angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.98,0:27:10.36,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.00,0:27:14.20,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,From Nagasaki, 18 years old — I'm Karen-ren, Fukui Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.28,0:27:15.00,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.13,0:27:18.51,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.51,0:27:21.79,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,I'd been thinking about this for a while too —
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.87,0:27:22.43,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Iori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.51,0:27:23.07,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.35,0:27:25.65,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You're popular today!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.73,0:27:28.07,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Might be the most presence ever, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.63,0:27:29.65,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,And it ends today, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.81,0:27:36.90,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,My goal this year is to be a beloved burikko,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.11,0:27:40.37,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,and Iori-san is the ultimate burikko, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.07,0:27:43.21,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,So I've decided on my own that she's my rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.29,0:27:43.73,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Doesn't she grab her skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.09,0:27:47.21,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Grabbing her skirt, not listening to anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.29,0:27:49.69,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,I'll do my best by copying Iori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.77,0:27:51.43,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Please take care of me all day today!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.46,0:27:59.03,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,From Fukuoka, a 14-year-old junior-high third-year — I'm Team H's Ikuno Rina!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.00,0:28:00.62,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.42,0:28:01.78,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.86,0:28:09.04,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,The member I see as my rival
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.12,0:28:11.66,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,is every junior-high third-year,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.28,0:28:14.84,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,since this year we're all studying for entrance exams, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.22,0:28:18.02,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,So I can't lose to them on brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.64,0:28:19.76,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,I'll study a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.67,0:28:23.63,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,and become the smartest of the junior-high third-year members.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.71,0:28:25.45,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Please look after me all day today too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.53,0:28:27.31,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.07,0:28:29.43,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.99,0:28:31.21,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,She's walking back all burikko!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.29,0:28:31.75,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Burikko!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.99,0:28:35.79,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Okay, when I say "super," please say "hero!"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.61,0:28:40.86,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Bright like the sun — Hakata's super—
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.94,0:28:42.16,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:46.95,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Thank you! From Fukuoka, 21 years old — I'm Team H's Kitagawa Hiiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.03,0:28:47.81,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Hiiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.68,0:28:51.08,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:55.62,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,The member I think of as my rival is Yuuna-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.12,0:28:57.80,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,like, about Yuuna-chan—
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.88,0:28:59.62,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Yuuna-chan, see,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.70,0:29:04.22,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,apparently I'm always slow getting my makeup ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.30,0:29:06.76,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,and Yuuna-chan always keeps watch on me
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.84,0:29:07.80,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,so I won't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.78,0:29:10.92,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Yuuna-chan gets ready really fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.00,0:29:13.08,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,and today she finished at incredible speed too,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.16,0:29:16.02,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,and while I was still in the middle of getting ready, Yuuna-chan showed up
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.10,0:29:18.66,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,and said, "Hiiro-chan, Yuuna's already done,"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.74,0:29:20.58,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,with a smug face.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.92,0:29:23.66,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,Right now Yuuna-chan wins by a landslide,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.06,0:29:25.88,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,so I'm not even close to being her rival,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.96,0:29:28.28,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,but from now on I'll get my makeup ready faster
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.36,0:29:29.64,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,and I hope I can become her rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.72,0:29:31.32,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,I'm in your care all day today!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.86,0:29:33.56,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:38.60,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Okay — Aki's "A" is the "A" of Asura, but my heart is a Bodhisattva.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.68,0:29:41.74,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Still in training, 25 years old — I'm Aki, Toyonaga Aki!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.82,0:29:42.44,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.91,0:29:50.09,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,It's a bit different from a "rival,"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.71,0:29:56.20,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,but the opponent I really have to beat soon is Shibui.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.15,0:29:59.91,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Because Shibui is really
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.00,0:30:03.16,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,a master of sophistry — when she gets scolded,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.24,0:30:04.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,even when I say, "This causes us trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.76,0:30:06.04,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so no, stop it,"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.12,0:30:08.90,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,for some reason she's the one giving permission: "It's fine!"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:12.30,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Even though we're the ones who decide whether it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.38,0:30:13.78,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Whenever I scold her for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.86,0:30:15.56,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,she says, "It's fine!"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.64,0:30:18.76,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so it's become a spear-versus-shield kind of battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.84,0:30:22.38,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,But today I thought the dressing room was kind of quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.46,0:30:23.80,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and it's a little annoying to admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.88,0:30:26.40,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,but without Shibui it's lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.48,0:30:29.10,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,So that Shibui keeps growing up healthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.18,0:30:31.22,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I want to raise her just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.58,0:30:33.34,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Today I'll work hard enough for Shibui too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.42,0:30:34.26,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.68,0:30:35.82,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.90,0:30:40.60,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Okay! My birthday is August 31 — Vegetable Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.68,0:30:41.86,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,What I (dago) love is cucumber!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.94,0:30:43.86,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,From Kumamoto — I'm Tanaka Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.28,0:30:49.24,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.33,0:30:51.21,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,The ones I think of as my rivals
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.29,0:30:53.93,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,are the young ones who are expected to grow,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.37,0:30:58.01,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,and by growth I mean height,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.09,0:31:02.07,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,but when I looked at the 7th-gen and 6th-gen profiles,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.15,0:31:05.77,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,everyone's grown so much I can't even stand next to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.85,0:31:09.63,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,I figured I'm not even tall enough to be compared anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.01,0:31:11.73,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,and my buddies are Koko-chan and Kuru-tan,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.81,0:31:15.59,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,so I want to stand shoulder to shoulder with those two and get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.67,0:31:17.41,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Okay, please look after me all day today!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.79,0:31:19.39,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.46,0:31:22.43,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Okay — born on February 9, Meat Day!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.51,0:31:24.17,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Beef tongue, pork tongue—
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.25,0:31:25.73,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Hina-tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.81,0:31:26.29,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.72,0:31:28.24,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,My charm point is being bright and energetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.32,0:31:30.66,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Meat-loving, from Fukuoka, a junior-high second—
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.70,0:31:35.84,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,— third-year, 14 years old — I'm Team KIV's Yasui Hina!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.26,0:31:43.38,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Hina's rival is Cucumber-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.38,0:31:49.72,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Meat and vegetables — you're rivals to begin with!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.80,0:31:51.94,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Your catchphrases are rivals!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.28,0:31:54.56,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,The reason Hina picked Cucumber-san is,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.12,0:31:56.92,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Cucumber-san loves cucumbers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.24,0:31:59.90,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Hina eats cucumbers every day too —
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.00,0:32:05.46,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,that's how much I love them. Probably not many people know it, but
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.18,0:32:08.60,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I think I love cucumbers more than Iori-san does.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.86,0:32:10.90,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,She's picking a fight with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.90,0:32:15.16,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Even if you fight over it, there's not much cucumber work, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.24,0:32:17.60,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Well, it might come someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.74,0:32:19.76,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,When that happens, let's get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.08,0:32:23.90,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Eat lots of cucumbers, okay? I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.12,0:32:26.50,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Okay, please look after me all day today!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.90,0:32:27.80,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.88,0:32:33.74,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Okay — pure, proper, beautiful! I can play 30 instruments —
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.82,0:32:35.68,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,the almighty Reiwa Princess Reia!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.76,0:32:38.38,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,From Kanagawa, 18 years old — I'm Yanase Reia!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.46,0:32:39.30,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Reia!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.90,0:32:42.60,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.58,0:32:50.00,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,My rivals are Iori-san, Saa-chan, and Matsumoto Moka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.82,0:32:57.18,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,There are three members from Kumamoto in HKT, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.74,0:33:03.72,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Lately I'm totally hooked on a zoo called Aso Cuddly Dominion in Aso City, Kumamoto,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.20,0:33:06.10,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,and I go there once a month from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.74,0:33:08.02,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,all the way to Aso in Kumamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.10,0:33:13.58,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,I love Aso Cuddly Dominion way too much, and I love Aso way too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.44,0:33:20.14,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,so if there's ever an Aso job, they'll definitely call the Kumamoto members, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.72,0:33:22.82,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,So from right here, right now:
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.90,0:33:24.46,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,I love Aso!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.62,0:33:26.96,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,I love Kumamoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.04,0:33:28.00,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,She's campaigning! Campaigning!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.08,0:33:31.06,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,That's way more work than cucumbers, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.14,0:33:32.00,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Sweating, sweating!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.08,0:33:34.56,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,What I (dago) love is Kumamoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.46,0:33:39.34,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,She spread it — and since this morning, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.39,0:33:42.71,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Iori's so kind, she'd probably just give it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.51,0:33:45.63,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,so I'd love for you to let me join in,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.71,0:33:47.35,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,and do our best as four.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.88,0:33:49.47,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Please look after me for the whole day!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.99,0:33:56.77,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Okay, when I point the mic at you, please say "Fu!"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.75,0:33:58.03,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.28,0:34:02.80,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Okay — in charge of warm smiles! I'll turn today into an eternal day!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.08,0:34:04.44,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.22,0:34:09.16,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,From Fukuoka, born in summer, 18 years old — I'm Team KIV's Izawa Miyu!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.24,0:34:10.02,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.02,0:34:11.38,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.08,0:34:19.76,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,The member I think of as my rival
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.84,0:34:24.98,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,is Reia-chan and Karen-chan, same gen and same age as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.06,0:34:30.30,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,The three of us were the former "Kou-3s" — the high-school third-year members —
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.08,0:34:32.98,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,but we've graduated high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.06,0:34:35.62,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so we can't call ourselves high-school girls anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.70,0:34:38.42,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,But still, among the three of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.50,0:34:43.56,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,who can be the most fresh and bubbly — I decided on my own —
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.32,0:34:46.54,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Amazing, amazing, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.49,0:34:53.49,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Amazing, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.97,0:34:54.19,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.21,0:34:58.67,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Because in H, you rarely get to see Reia treated like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.75,0:34:59.75,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.02,0:35:04.40,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so I asked them their favorite foods.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.48,0:35:05.72,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,That's sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.68,0:35:09.06,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Reia-chan said chawanmushi,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.14,0:35:11.04,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Karen-chan said prosciutto,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.12,0:35:12.46,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and mine is gyoza,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.54,0:35:14.62,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,so everyone's favorites are pretty much neck and neck —
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.70,0:35:16.20,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,that's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.28,0:35:19.16,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,So today, so I can dance the most bubbly,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.24,0:35:19.76,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.84,0:35:21.16,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Please look after me all day today too!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.92,0:35:29.52,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Okay — today too: safety first, health first —
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.60,0:35:30.22,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,everyone's...?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.30,0:35:31.32,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Ai-chii!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.64,0:35:33.49,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.64,0:35:36.00,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,From Kanagawa — I'm Aichi, Ichimura Airi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.19,0:35:47.50,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Okay — the HKT member I want to become a rival to someday
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.05,0:35:50.81,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,is a former HKT48 member,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.53,0:35:53.51,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Yamamoto Mao-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.55,0:35:57.15,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,I've never even spoken to her once,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.23,0:35:59.81,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,so I'm truly humbled to even say her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.92,0:36:03.52,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Since yesterday, on the sub-channel,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.94,0:36:07.62,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Aichi's golf program, Ai-Golf, has started!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.44,0:36:08.80,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.31,0:36:10.95,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.03,0:36:16.60,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,It's a show where I learn golf from scratch, with zero experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.91,0:36:21.41,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,and Yamamoto Mao-san is famous for being super good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.49,0:36:21.89,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,At golf.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.97,0:36:24.75,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,So I really don't know how many years it'll take,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.83,0:36:27.87,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,but someday I want to get good enough to be her rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.95,0:36:30.07,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Please watch the videos too. Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.71,0:36:32.03,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.98,0:36:36.40,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Okay, when I say "se-no," please say "Kokoha!"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.06,0:36:37.86,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Okaaay!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.04,0:36:40.64,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Where is this place? Who am I? Se-no—
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.82,0:36:41.58,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Kokoha!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.70,0:36:47.00,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Thank you! From Fukuoka, a 16-year-old high-school second-year — I'm Fujino Kokoha!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.28,0:36:47.98,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Kokoha!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:51.40,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.36,0:36:56.94,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,For me, it's the members of the Prosciutto Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.26,0:36:59.76,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,I'm in a club called the Fried Rice Club, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.84,0:37:03.38,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,And I thought Prosciutto was just Karen-ren,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.46,0:37:06.88,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,but I heard that Akiyoshi-san joined recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.96,0:37:09.92,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,and I thought, fried rice isn't winning at all anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.00,0:37:13.52,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,But as club president, I want to do my best too,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:16.82,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,and since it's Wednesday, I'm definitely eating fried rice when I get home,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.90,0:37:18.24,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,so everyone, please eat some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.32,0:37:19.88,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Please look after me all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.40,0:37:22.06,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.02,0:37:27.72,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Okay, everyone, clap and call with me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.71,0:37:31.49,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Se-no — and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.57,0:37:34.91,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Looking sharp today — (Saaya!)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.05,0:37:36.53,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Coloring your mind — (Saaya!)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.65,0:37:38.29,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Team H, pardon the intrusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.25,0:37:41.15,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.66,0:37:44.62,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,From Kumamoto — I'm Team KIV's Morisaki Saaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.22,0:37:50.62,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.76,0:37:53.24,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,My rival
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.70,0:37:55.48,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,is Yanase Reia-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.56,0:37:59.84,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Earlier I heard — get this — that she loves chawanmushi,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.00,0:38:05.36,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,but I love it so much I even put chawanmushi in my profile!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.44,0:38:06.40,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yes, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.02,0:38:13.72,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,I keep saying things like "I love sushi-restaurant chawanmushi,"
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.68,0:38:19.80,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Someday I'd like to do a chawanmushi taste-test showdown with Rei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.88,0:38:25.90,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Today, um, I'm subbing for Shibui Mina-chan, so I asked for Shibui Mina-chan's hairstyle,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.38,0:38:29.68,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,so they did my hair in half-twintails like Shibui Mina-chan,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.40,0:38:33.70,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and I want to liven things up energetically like Shibui Mina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.78,0:38:35.34,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Please look after me today, all day long!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.42,0:38:37.82,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.15,0:38:41.43,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Okay — rin-rin—
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.51,0:38:42.41,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Rinka!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.49,0:38:47.19,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Little by little, steadily — my charm point is my big sparkly eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.27,0:38:51.07,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,From Hyogo, a 17-year-old high-school third-year — I'm Ouchi Rinka!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.97,0:38:56.73,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.00,0:39:00.74,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,My rival is Aichi-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.82,0:39:06.18,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,officially, I'm an 'Aichiru' — one of 'Airi's Children' —
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.26,0:39:11.02,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,She's also my mentor, and when Aichi-san says something funny in the MC and the fans laugh,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.10,0:39:14.44,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,I get really frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.52,0:39:15.12,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.16,0:39:20.50,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,She's so funny it frustrates me — even though I'm from Kansai!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.16,0:39:22.06,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,That makes you happy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.14,0:39:23.00,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.08,0:39:24.78,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,So that's what you were thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.86,0:39:29.96,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,I'll keep respecting her and work to get funny enough to be a good rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.04,0:39:31.80,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Today, please look after me all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.48,0:39:34.46,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.03,0:39:36.38,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.46,0:39:38.07,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,My worried face and droopy eyes are my charm points!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.15,0:39:39.01,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,Always smiling—
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.09,0:39:41.61,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,It's Yuina!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.69,0:39:44.43,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,A 13-year-old junior-high second-year — I'm Ishimatsu Yuina!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.51,0:39:45.39,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,Please look after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.47,0:39:46.49,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yuina!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.14,0:39:49.50,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.82,0:39:53.16,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,The members I think of as my rivals
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.88,0:39:55.60,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,are members I can almost
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.68,0:39:57.66,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,overtake in height —
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.36,0:39:59.24,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,like Rinka,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.00,0:40:02.10,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,and Aichi-san is... a bit further off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.18,0:40:02.96,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Uh-oh, uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.04,0:40:03.26,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.36,0:40:03.96,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.04,0:40:04.50,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,Almost overtaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.58,0:40:08.13,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Danger, danger, danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.67,0:40:14.07,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,I can almost overtake them, so I'll sleep a lot and keep growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.15,0:40:16.13,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,Okay, please look after me all day today too!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.58,0:40:18.35,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.19,0:40:24.31,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Okay — the Team H Mokugekisha show is brought to you by the members above!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.39,0:40:26.95,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Are you all ready to get hyped?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.09,0:40:29.09,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.46,0:40:29.67,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.87,0:40:33.33,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Next up, various units take the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.41,0:40:33.99,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.60,1:01:33.22,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Ude wo Kunde, Enjou Rosen,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.30,1:01:34.34,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Itoshisa no Accel,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.42,1:01:35.52,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Hoshi no Mukougawa,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.60,1:01:37.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and Saboten to Gold Rush —
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.26,1:01:39.08,Default,Member,0,0,60,,you heard five songs in a row!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.16,1:01:40.76,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Is everyone having fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.94,1:01:42.56,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.43,1:01:47.39,Default,Member,0,0,60,,For this MC, we'd like to talk with these members.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.47,1:01:49.01,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Whoa, it's only 6th gens!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.87,1:01:50.91,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.99,1:01:52.71,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,So many of you are on today, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.79,1:01:55.43,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Hina-tan, is this your first time?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.63,1:01:56.57,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,It's my first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.01,1:01:57.87,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,First Saboten!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.41,1:01:59.71,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Your first Saboten?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.83,1:02:00.91,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,First Saboten.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.99,1:02:01.55,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.30,1:02:04.10,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.14,1:02:06.02,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.10,1:02:08.52,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,She's the youngest, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.60,1:02:09.20,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.50,1:02:12.46,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,When I was in the dressing room in this outfit,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.54,1:02:14.36,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,they said I looked like a baby,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.44,1:02:16.12,Default,Member,0,0,60,,with the big ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.00,1:02:18.62,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,and I got a little embarrassed,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.70,1:02:20.44,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,and I was nervous before going on, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.52,1:02:22.86,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,The older members all wear them too, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.94,1:02:23.58,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.66,1:02:25.58,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,It's fine — it suits you, it suits you!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.66,1:02:26.54,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.42,1:02:33.38,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,But thinking about it, our age range is pretty wide, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.28,1:02:36.88,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Like the stuff that was popular back then,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.96,1:02:42.20,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,and what we watched on TV — that's probably totally different.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.68,1:02:44.54,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Someone looks happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.16,1:02:46.78,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,There's someone who looks happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.86,1:02:50.12,Default,Member,0,0,60,,But it's a seven-year gap, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.20,1:02:51.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thirteen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.10,1:02:51.32,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Five?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.92,1:02:53.88,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.36,1:02:55.50,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Seven? Eight?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.58,1:02:56.76,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,We didn't even overlap in elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.84,1:02:57.64,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.72,1:02:59.26,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Scary, scary!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.72,1:03:02.20,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Wait, this is scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.00,1:03:03.72,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.32,1:03:05.96,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,So what we watched is different, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.04,1:03:11.34,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,When I was little, I loved variety shows on TV,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.08,1:03:13.64,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,like Haneru no Tobira.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.74,1:03:17.28,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Looks like you don't know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.36,1:03:18.18,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,You don't know it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.42,1:03:18.78,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,No?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.88,1:03:20.24,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.32,1:03:21.72,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Scary, scary, scary!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.80,1:03:22.76,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You don't know it either?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.88,1:03:23.38,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.46,1:03:26.88,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,You don't know Haneru no Tobira?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.06,1:03:28.80,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,How about Enta no Kamisama?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.88,1:03:30.00,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,I know that, I know that!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.08,1:03:32.46,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,That one's been... lately —
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.54,1:03:33.24,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.32,1:03:34.72,Default,Ishimatsu Yuina,0,0,60,,They're doing it, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.80,1:03:37.88,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Or Pikaru no Teiri?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.78,1:03:39.70,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.78,1:03:40.92,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I don't know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.00,1:03:42.73,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.81,1:03:44.53,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,What do you watch,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.61,1:03:46.05,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,like variety shows?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.13,1:03:49.65,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,It's all recent stuff, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.73,1:03:51.97,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I only watch recent stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.05,1:03:54.39,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,For dramas, I'm
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.47,1:03:56.93,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,the same age as Ashida Mana-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.13,1:03:59.01,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.09,1:03:59.73,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Yes, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.37,1:04:05.21,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Mana-san has grown up so splendidly, and yet —
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.38,1:04:07.18,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Mana-san!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.26,1:04:08.10,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Mana-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.18,1:04:12.00,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Marumo no Okite —
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.08,1:04:14.63,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,I watched that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.71,1:04:16.03,Default,Member,0,0,60,,True, true.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.11,1:04:18.07,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Live a little more like Mana-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.99,1:04:20.27,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Like someone her age.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.21,1:04:24.47,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,What about purikura?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.55,1:04:25.45,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,Aichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.53,1:04:26.65,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Of course, I've taken them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.19,1:04:29.05,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Of course I've taken some!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.13,1:04:31.85,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Was the machine type Print Club?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.93,1:04:33.95,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Yeah, there were all kinds, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.03,1:04:34.43,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.51,1:04:37.29,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,People also call it "Print Club," right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.37,1:04:38.29,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,They do, they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.37,1:04:40.35,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.03,1:04:42.25,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,You took them, of course?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.33,1:04:43.43,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Of course, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.51,1:04:47.05,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,That much, obviously, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.97,1:04:50.37,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Because even educational shows —
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.45,1:04:53.13,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,probably the singing big sisters
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.21,1:04:57.31,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,and big brothers are different people for each generation.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.09,1:04:59.79,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.00,1:05:03.60,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,For me, it was Takumi-oneesan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.58,1:05:09.20,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I shouldn't say "I don't know her," but —
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.28,1:05:12.02,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,True, there are lots of older members, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.50,1:05:14.48,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,There are lots of older members, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.90,1:05:16.80,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,For me, it was Ida Shoko-oneesan,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.04,1:05:20.00,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,and Sato Hiromichi-oniisan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.12,1:05:22.20,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Ah, that era, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.18,1:05:25.96,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,I'm on your side!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.04,1:05:27.58,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,A lot of people know them, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.66,1:05:29.44,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Yeah, that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.08,1:05:31.44,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,So these days,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.50,1:05:34.24,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Hina-tan, what did you watch
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.90,1:05:35.68,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,growing up?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.20,1:05:37.28,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Hina, though —
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.36,1:05:39.38,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,when I watch TV,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.46,1:05:41.78,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I basically watch Dokkiri GP a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.86,1:05:43.22,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,That's a recent one, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.30,1:05:45.40,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Right, prank shows too.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.48,1:05:47.32,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I love prank shows.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.40,1:05:49.56,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Back in the day they were pretty big productions,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.10,1:05:51.46,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,like explosions.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.40,1:05:54.22,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,You don't really see those lately, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.30,1:05:54.65,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.73,1:05:55.92,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,There's that, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.96,1:05:58.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I don't watch much TV.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.78,1:06:04.46,Default,Member,0,0,60,,These days you can watch on streaming apps on your phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.96,1:06:07.08,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,And now, even if it's not real-time,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.12,1:06:11.22,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,we watch the archives, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.82,1:06:15.12,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,This is Reiwa.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.94,1:06:19.00,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,So interesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.08,1:06:23.44,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Actually, it's amazing that it works even with such an age gap.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.52,1:06:25.06,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,It's the same here, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.06,1:06:27.76,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,This community's the same, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.84,1:06:29.72,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Age doesn't matter, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.86,1:06:31.90,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Everyone, let's have fun
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.98,1:06:33.74,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and keep getting along from here on!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.60,1:06:36.38,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Next, we'd like to move on to the second half.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.46,1:06:38.16,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Can everyone still get hyped?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.39,1:06:42.37,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Can you get even louder?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.39,1:06:46.91,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Next up is the second half!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.99,1:06:47.59,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.62,1:18:39.38,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Utsukushiki Mono, Ai wo Kure, and Matenrou no Kyori — you heard three songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.46,1:18:40.96,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Is everyone hyped?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.49,1:18:44.55,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.03,1:18:48.33,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,For this MC, we'd like to talk with these members.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.41,1:18:50.95,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Does anyone have something to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.27,1:18:52.51,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Then, may I?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.35,1:18:55.79,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Something surprising happened in the dressing room today.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.97,1:19:00.33,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Apparently the air in the dressing room was cold,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.41,1:19:04.73,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and Sae-san came today to adjust the air conditioning —
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.81,1:19:06.05,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Apparently she was hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.13,1:19:08.13,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and she came over going, "Mm-hm, mm-hm."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.21,1:19:11.61,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Right, a certain someone said "It's hot."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.69,1:19:13.37,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"That person," right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.45,1:19:15.95,Default,Member,0,0,60,,And Sae-san, in super-polite language,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.03,1:19:18.63,Default,Member,0,0,60,,was asking someone, "Um, what temperature should I set it to?"
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.71,1:19:22.39,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Like, there aren't many seniors from 3rd gen and up
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.47,1:19:23.75,Default,Member,0,0,60,,here today, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.83,1:19:26.13,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Today, "that person" was here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.21,1:19:29.45,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yes, yes, and I wondered who she was asking,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.53,1:19:32.39,Default,Member,0,0,60,,so I followed her gaze, dot, dot, dot,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.47,1:19:34.37,Default,Member,0,0,60,,and it was my own same-gen, Ouchi Rinka!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.45,1:19:35.55,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.67,1:19:38.73,Default,Member,0,0,60,,From Rinka-sama!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.55,1:19:40.73,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Because she's "that person."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.79,1:19:45.13,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Like, the Team H dressing room gets dry,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.21,1:19:49.03,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,so we don't really run the AC during makeup,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.45,1:19:51.95,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,but maybe KIV always does?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.45,1:19:55.35,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Rinka was the first one to say, "Isn't it hot?"
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.67,1:19:58.85,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Rinka-sama, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.93,1:20:02.09,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Since she said it, I asked, "Hot?"
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.17,1:20:05.61,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,and she said, "A little hot," so
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.69,1:20:09.55,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,I said, "I'll turn on the AC," and went to turn it on,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.00,1:20:13.50,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,because Rinka was having her hair done by the makeup artist,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.88,1:20:15.50,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,so she couldn't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.58,1:20:16.52,Default,Kitagawa Hiiro,0,0,60,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.60,1:20:17.48,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Right, so I went in her place.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.56,1:20:18.18,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.26,1:20:19.46,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So Sae-san kept asking,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.54,1:20:21.54,Default,Member,0,0,60,,"Um, what temperature? What temperature?"
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.62,1:20:22.46,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,asking like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.54,1:20:23.38,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,it's startling!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.46,1:20:25.42,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Officially, Rinka is my Aichiru, you know —
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.50,1:20:27.12,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,she's here as my apprentice, but
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.20,1:20:28.56,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,So, the coaching —
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.96,1:20:31.68,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Is that how it is?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.62,1:20:33.94,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Officially, she listens to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.02,1:20:36.82,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,because I'm her mentor, see.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.90,1:20:39.32,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,So you're saying she uses polite language with me too?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.74,1:20:42.92,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Seriously crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.94,1:20:45.58,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Joke, joke!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.66,1:20:47.06,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,I said it's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.14,1:20:48.80,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,That's not okay, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.88,1:20:50.62,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Just so you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.70,1:20:52.84,Default,Member,0,0,60,,among us today, Sae-chan and Yuuna-chan
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.92,1:20:53.94,Default,Member,0,0,60,,are the most senior.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.02,1:20:55.38,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.46,1:20:56.40,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.26,1:20:58.98,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Just a bit —
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.06,1:21:01.36,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,when I tried to say it, it got heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.44,1:21:03.12,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,The mood got heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.20,1:21:05.36,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,HKT is, like,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.44,1:21:07.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,how do I put it,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.26,1:21:08.18,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,that kind of —
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.26,1:21:08.80,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.90,1:21:13.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yeah, yesterday, like, the scary stuff — how do I put it —
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.12,1:21:17.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,we're a group that wants to get rid of that, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.12,1:21:18.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.26,1:21:19.56,Default,Member,0,0,60,,But I'll be strict, then!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.64,1:21:21.34,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.42,1:21:21.88,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.34,1:21:22.74,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.94,1:21:23.52,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.78,1:21:24.92,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,People like this —
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.00,1:21:27.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,because there are people like this, being strict —
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.12,1:21:27.47,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.55,1:21:28.10,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.60,1:21:31.36,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Joke, joke, joke, joke!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.44,1:21:32.86,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,This is the MC, after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.94,1:21:34.26,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Laugh, laugh!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.34,1:21:36.76,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,I know — I'm joking too!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.84,1:21:38.22,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,That's what's scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.64,1:21:39.30,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.76,1:21:40.34,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,A joke, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.42,1:21:41.42,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,And scene!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.18,1:21:45.64,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Ten years in, please spare me that role.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.72,1:21:48.84,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Because there might be people here seeing us for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.92,1:21:50.02,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.10,1:21:52.70,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,and if they think HKT is bad or something, that'd be terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.48,1:21:54.60,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,That's what I'm saying!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.68,1:21:55.32,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,And scene!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.34,1:21:57.82,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,You're trying so hard to smooth it over.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.90,1:21:59.40,Default,Member,0,0,60,,What year are you even in?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.48,1:22:00.64,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's settled.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.72,1:22:01.38,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,All settled.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.88,1:22:02.40,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.48,1:22:03.36,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Then, a little —
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.44,1:22:07.80,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Um, yeah, something a little embarrassing happened to me recently.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.34,1:22:10.42,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,When I was out with Sae-chan,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.50,1:22:15.80,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,while we were out, I found a shop in town,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.56,1:22:22.30,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,and they had something like clothes on display.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.38,1:22:25.04,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Were you window-shopping?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.12,1:22:27.68,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,We were looking at a clothing store, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.76,1:22:30.70,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,There was something I thought was cute,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.36,1:22:36.36,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,so I went closer saying "Cute!" and the sign said "Dog Shop."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.18,1:22:38.88,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,So in the end, those were dog clothes!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.96,1:22:42.98,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,I'd been calling dog clothes cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.06,1:22:44.62,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It's less embarrassing than scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.96,1:22:47.02,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,They were for dogs.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.24,1:22:49.50,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,You're kind of dog-like, so they'd suit you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.58,1:22:52.44,Default,Member,0,0,60,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.68,1:22:54.98,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,They were kind of cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.06,1:22:56.10,Default,Member,0,0,60,,That's way too random.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.84,1:22:58.94,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Karen-ren size — about this big.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.48,1:23:00.40,Default,Fujino Kokoha,0,0,60,,You won't fit!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.48,1:23:01.56,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,You won't fit, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.64,1:23:04.08,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Has anyone had something embarrassing happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.16,1:23:05.34,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Around you, lately?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.42,1:23:06.78,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.80,1:23:08.54,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.62,1:23:10.54,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Yasui-chan looks like she has one.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.62,1:23:12.28,Default,Member,0,0,60,,She's lowering her mic.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.36,1:23:13.70,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.70,1:23:15.66,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,It was embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.36,1:23:19.22,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Red ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.58,1:23:21.16,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.34,1:23:23.30,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Even during Kokoten—
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.38,1:23:24.98,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,I always get teased about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.56,1:23:26.46,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,"Your ears are red."
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.54,1:23:28.30,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,That's cute!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.18,1:23:30.64,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,What is this, the dressing room?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.72,1:23:33.48,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Girl talk!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.56,1:23:37.92,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Getting embarrassed and only being able to walk around covering the ears —
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.62,1:23:40.74,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,that's Hina's embarrassing episode.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.82,1:23:41.74,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,Cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.82,1:23:44.42,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Could you wrap it up for us, quickly?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.10,1:23:51.30,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Um, Hina gets embarrassed, and her ears turning red is what's embarrassing —
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.90,1:23:53.36,Default,Member,0,0,60,,No good, no good, no good!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.60,1:23:57.00,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,You're just repeating exactly what just happened!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.08,1:23:59.00,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,This is how you do a wrap-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.50,1:24:00.66,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Ta-dah!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.30,1:24:05.06,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Go ahead! Go ahead, go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.50,1:24:09.90,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,What kind of wrap-up is that?!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.00,1:24:11.60,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,That surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.68,1:24:13.52,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,It was so hard to follow, it surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.60,1:24:16.88,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Okay, the second-half group will talk with these members.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.96,1:24:17.42,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.50,1:24:19.34,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Do you have anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.42,1:24:20.94,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Yes, um, the other day I
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.02,1:24:25.66,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,went to Disneyland with Aki-san, Hiiro, and Nanaka-chan,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.02,1:24:30.10,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and while enjoying Disneyland, at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.18,1:24:32.60,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,we were carrying out a certain operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.04,1:24:35.04,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,As people call it: the "Aki-chance."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.86,1:24:38.84,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Only two people call it that — only three people call it that, the Aki-chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.92,1:24:40.08,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,It's called the Aki-chance,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.16,1:24:42.64,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,and it's — while we're at Disneyland,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.72,1:24:45.32,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,normally we call her Aki-san, but
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.40,1:24:47.60,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,how many times we can say "Aki-chan" without getting caught —
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.44,1:24:49.34,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,that's the operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.94,1:24:50.80,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.88,1:24:53.18,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,From inviting her to Disneyland,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.26,1:24:54.26,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,it had already started.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.34,1:24:57.28,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,So I called Aki-san on the phone —
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.36,1:24:59.32,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Huh? You invited her by phone?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.72,1:25:02.58,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Isn't a phone call hard to turn down?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.62,1:25:05.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Let's hear Zawa's story first, then —
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.68,1:25:07.24,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,let me have my say too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.32,1:25:09.30,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Got it. I just got curious.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.38,1:25:11.26,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,And she picked up before it even rang once.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.38,1:25:11.88,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.10,1:25:14.02,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Yes. And she went, "What's up?"
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.58,1:25:16.06,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,"Next time, to Disneyland —
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.14,1:25:18.74,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Nanaka-chan, Hiiro and I are thinking of going, the three of us —
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.12,1:25:21.40,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Aki-chan, are you free?" — like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.48,1:25:22.72,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,When I said that, she said, "I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.84,1:25:24.80,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Sure, let's go," like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.88,1:25:25.56,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,She said that, so
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.70,1:25:27.58,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,I thought, "Hey, she might not notice!"
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.82,1:25:30.32,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Then: "So, Aki-chan, what attraction do you like?"
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.26,1:25:32.98,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,I slipped it in casually, and
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.06,1:25:36.04,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,then: "You might not have realized it yet, but
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.12,1:25:37.88,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,I caught on from the very first one."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.96,1:25:38.58,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.66,1:25:40.09,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,I'd been found out.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.17,1:25:40.95,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.03,1:25:44.23,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Honestly, the two of them calling me
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.61,1:25:46.43,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,is already rare to begin with, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.51,1:25:47.15,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.23,1:25:50.21,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,So I pick up at least a little worried, you know —
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.29,1:25:51.51,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,a call from juniors,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.59,1:25:52.67,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I wonder if something happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.75,1:25:54.31,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I pick up, "What's up?"
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.39,1:25:55.97,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and their voices are grinning,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.05,1:25:57.89,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,going, "She picked up!"
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.63,1:26:01.73,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,— this is obviously me imitating Kitagawa Hiiro, but —
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.81,1:26:03.31,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,"Ah, she picked up!" like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.75,1:26:05.13,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,"Oh no, oh no!" like that,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.21,1:26:09.45,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and then, "Aki-chan, can you go to Disneyland?"
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.00,1:26:14.66,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,From the invitation on, I thought the whole thing might be a prank.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.40,1:26:17.62,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Like, I'm totally happy to go, but
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.70,1:26:20.52,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,am I really being invited?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.60,1:26:23.44,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,But then we actually went.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.52,1:26:29.30,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,After we went, it turned out they'd been doing the Aki-chance without telling me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.68,1:26:34.08,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Normally you'd do that because you want to be able to call me Aki-chan,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.16,1:26:40.18,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so you'd think the point is saying it naturally, without it sounding forced, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.26,1:26:43.16,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,"Then show me the one you think worked best," I said —
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.24,1:26:46.28,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Mine is the sneeze-style "Aki-chan."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.36,1:26:47.00,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.44,1:26:47.76,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.10,1:26:50.16,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,A-ki-CHAN!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.54,1:26:53.96,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and they said, "This one worked best!"
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.66,1:26:59.04,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,And the more this turns into a success for these kids,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.12,1:27:02.20,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,the more I think it's a sign I'll never get called Aki-chan for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.58,1:27:02.94,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.40,1:27:05.26,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Scary, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.34,1:27:07.10,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,For Reia, it's unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.18,1:27:08.20,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.28,1:27:10.00,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Hearing that, first of all —
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.14,1:27:14.38,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,I thought, they're kind of taking her lightly.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.44,1:27:16.78,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,That's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.86,1:27:18.50,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,But picking up the phone is impressive, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.14,1:27:21.40,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,If it were me, I'd definitely wait for it to stop ringing,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.48,1:27:24.90,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,and after it cut off, on LINE,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.98,1:27:25.90,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,ask "What's up?"
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.60,1:27:27.54,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I'd be worried, you know!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.62,1:27:29.64,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Because nobody ever calls me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.72,1:27:30.12,Default,Ouchi Rinka,0,0,60,,True.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.20,1:27:32.94,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Right, I wondered if something had happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.36,1:27:38.12,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I thought they were such serious kids, back then.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.64,1:27:39.44,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,She thought so.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.52,1:27:42.36,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,But after that, every time I said no,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.44,1:27:44.42,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,they'd call me about really trivial stuff:
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.32,1:27:46.84,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,"What are you doing now?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.92,1:27:48.36,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Wanna play at the park?" like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.44,1:27:50.42,Default,All,0,0,60,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.50,1:27:53.14,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Even getting invitations like in Sazae-san,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.86,1:27:55.78,Default,Member,0,0,60,,like, "Let's play baseball!"
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.84,1:27:59.18,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So do you go along, Aki-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.26,1:28:02.00,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I'm someone who goes to the park with my mom and looks at cherry blossoms from a bench.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.08,1:28:03.12,Default,All,0,0,60,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.64,1:28:06.10,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Hey then, Aki-chan, go to Disney with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.18,1:28:06.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Sure, fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.64,1:28:09.48,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,You're the one who can't call me that!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.40,1:28:11.74,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Because, you know Rino?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.40,1:28:15.54,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,The reason Rino always calls me "Captain"
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.08,1:28:19.02,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,is definitely because it's too embarrassing to call me Aki-chan now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.10,1:28:21.64,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Yeah, it's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.00,1:28:23.90,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,A bit late for that now, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.98,1:28:26.66,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,This person should be the one doing Aki-chance the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.24,1:28:28.92,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,No, no, no, no — don't, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.00,1:28:30.38,Default,Sakamoto Rino,0,0,60,,Too much hassle, too much hassle.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.46,1:28:31.76,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Since you jumped in on your own —
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.84,1:28:35.58,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,I get the impression Aki-san and Rino-san have juniors call them "-chan,"
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.66,1:28:37.86,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,but Iori-san, do you have them call you something?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.94,1:28:42.78,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Getting that close is still a bit of a hurdle.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.86,1:28:45.66,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Then, "Iori-chan" is long, so —
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.74,1:28:47.60,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Right, "Iori-chan" is kind of long.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.68,1:28:49.46,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,How about a burikko nickname, right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.26,1:28:51.04,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Right now — true.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.12,1:28:51.90,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Like "Iyo-tan"?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.98,1:28:53.60,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Don't throw that kind of curveball!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.32,1:28:56.06,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Then who's your closest junior?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.16,1:28:59.62,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,The closest — well, I spend the most time with Saa-chan, but
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.70,1:29:01.52,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Saa-chan still calls me Iori-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.60,1:29:02.76,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,"Iori-san," "Ii-ko-san."
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.84,1:29:05.50,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,But like Hina-tan, "Cucumber-san" might work.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.14,1:29:06.82,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Cucumber-san, huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.90,1:29:07.28,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Lots of options.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.12,1:29:09.78,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,There's a theory that's more disrespectful than "-chan."
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.86,1:29:11.24,Default,Member,0,0,60,,I thought so too.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.92,1:29:15.26,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Let's keep senior-junior relationships proper.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.34,1:29:17.48,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,Let's be careful about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.56,1:29:19.78,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,So, the second-half group will wrap up around here,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.42,1:29:21.62,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,and we'd like to go to the last song,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.70,1:29:22.88,Default,Yanase Reia,0,0,60,,so everyone, please come out!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.70,1:49:12.96,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I'm crying and Zutto Zutto — you heard two songs in a row.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.04,1:49:18.50,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Here we'd like to hear everyone's thoughts on the show. First, Saaya, who jumped in on short notice!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.27,1:49:28.60,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Thank you! Yes, today it was last-minute for me, but
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.87,1:49:31.97,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,thank you for coming to the theater like this, and
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.59,1:49:34.65,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,thank you to everyone watching the stream, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.01,1:49:42.75,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Um, I was subbing for Shibui-chan, but
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.41,1:49:45.49,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,today, Karen —
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.17,1:49:48.25,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Yes, it's a new position for her!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.63,1:49:51.41,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,She was told yesterday, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.28,1:49:53.70,Default,Member,0,0,60,,You did great!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.84,1:50:00.26,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,How many times are you going to help Team H?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.65,1:50:04.23,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,"Won't you come to Team H?" A sudden scouting!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.97,1:50:09.02,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Karen-ren and I, and everyone in Team KIV, too —
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.48,1:50:15.20,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,including covering for the Team H members who aren't here right now —
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.04,1:50:21.54,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,so we can deliver good performances to everyone as HKT48,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.62,1:50:23.64,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,I want to do my best today too,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.72,1:50:25.26,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,so everyone, please keep coming to see us!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.34,1:50:26.02,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.70,1:50:32.20,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,And Karen-ren?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.48,1:50:34.90,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Thank you for coming today,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.98,1:50:37.22,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,and thank you for watching on DMM, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.19,1:50:46.91,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Yes, today I was in a new position,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.99,1:50:49.91,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,and in the Mokugekisha show, it's my fifth position — a new one.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.63,1:50:51.97,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.41,1:50:54.03,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Thank you so much, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.43,1:50:58.86,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Getting to see all kinds of views from lots of positions,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.23,1:51:05.47,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,and showing the fans all different sides of me makes me really happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.55,1:51:07.75,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,and I love the Mokugekisha show,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.83,1:51:09.41,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,so to keep appearing in it,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.49,1:51:11.91,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,I'll learn lots of positions and do my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.99,1:51:12.89,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Thank you for today!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.83,1:51:16.09,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Truly admirable.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.17,1:51:17.11,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.72,1:51:20.05,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Hey, how about considering a concurrent position too?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.13,1:51:20.95,Default,Ichimura Airi,0,0,60,,That's so true.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.03,1:51:23.47,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Everyone, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.07,1:51:25.27,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Always, really —
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.35,1:51:26.37,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,thank you so much, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.81,1:51:29.47,Default,Member,0,0,60,,The KIV members, too,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.11,1:51:32.73,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and the Team H members — their growth
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.81,1:51:34.41,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,is remarkable, but — Ikuno-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.22,1:51:35.82,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.90,1:51:37.86,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,No, nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.94,1:51:39.16,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,How was today?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.52,1:51:41.86,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Thank you for coming to the theater today,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.94,1:51:43.36,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,and for watching on DMM.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.82,1:51:49.18,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.14,1:51:53.32,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,I did Enjou Rosen with Yuuna-san,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.40,1:51:55.20,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,and since she called me her rival,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.76,1:51:56.12,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,I was a bit —
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.92,1:51:58.76,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,I tried to stretch up, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.84,1:51:59.94,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,but couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.80,1:52:02.44,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Yeah, like —
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.52,1:52:05.84,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,apparently she said it as a kind of hint.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.92,1:52:07.60,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,Stop, saying that makes it embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.04,1:52:09.88,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,So that's how it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.44,1:52:11.60,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,You were laying the groundwork!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.68,1:52:13.16,Default,Yamauchi Yuna,0,0,60,,I was laying the groundwork, so don't say it!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.46,1:52:18.52,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,I was happy I got to do Enjou Rosen so much with Yuuna-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.74,1:52:23.08,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,And lots of the KIV members came too,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.98,1:52:25.70,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,and I got to hang out with them a lot, so I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.78,1:52:26.48,Default,Ikuno Rina,0,0,60,,Thank you for today!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.69,1:52:34.39,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Really, just like she said,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.47,1:52:36.17,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,lots of KIV members have come,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.57,1:52:39.25,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and trainees are appearing too, and
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.33,1:52:39.85,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,really —
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.00,1:52:41.78,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,the phrase "with everyone's help" —
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.86,1:52:43.08,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,I always tend to use it, but
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.16,1:52:45.56,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,you can see faces you won't see at other shows
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.64,1:52:47.98,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,at the Mokugekisha show, and
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.06,1:52:49.68,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,as Team H, the other day,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.76,1:52:51.92,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,we all talked about lots of things —
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.00,1:52:53.98,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,about showing an even newer side,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.06,1:52:55.92,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,updated versions of ourselves —
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.00,1:52:58.02,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so that we can show that, by
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.10,1:53:00.10,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,influencing each other every day and working hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.18,1:53:02.32,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,That's what we all talked about, so
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.88,1:53:04.08,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,so that the results
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.16,1:53:05.22,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,can be shown here, day after day,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.30,1:53:07.18,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,to all of you,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.26,1:53:08.64,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,we'll work hard too,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.72,1:53:12.16,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and to be people who can bring energy to your hearts every day
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.24,1:53:14.06,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,and give you vitality —
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.14,1:53:16.66,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,we want to keep being that, so
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.74,1:53:20.04,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,please keep coming to the theater; it would make us happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.12,1:53:21.36,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Please keep supporting us!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.22,1:53:23.02,Default,All,0,0,60,,Please, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.62,1:53:31.92,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Now, everyone, the next one will be the last song —
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.00,1:53:32.92,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,can you raise your voices?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.00,1:53:37.40,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,It's Wednesday, but can you raise your voices?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.58,1:53:39.88,Default,Crowd,0,0,60,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.81,1:53:44.23,Default,Member,0,0,60,,So don't say it all — it gets embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.55,1:53:47.51,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Everyone, the weekend's still ahead,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.59,1:53:49.59,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,there's still time till the weekend, but can you raise your voices?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.91,1:53:52.31,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.77,1:53:54.23,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Please listen to our last song:
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.31,1:53:55.31,Default,Toyonaga Aki,0,0,60,,Pioneer!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.18,1:58:15.86,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Se-no—
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.86,1:58:18.30,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.88,2:00:52.64,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Keep working hard from tomorrow too!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.38,2:00:55.14,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.86,2:00:57.72,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.12,2:01:07.58,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,The show's over!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.40,2:01:15.12,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Today, we of KIV got to appear in Team H's show.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.64,2:01:16.30,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.98,2:01:18.90,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,That makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.60,2:01:21.64,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,So, how was it, really?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.74,2:01:23.10,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,How about you, Karen?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.72,2:01:28.43,Default,Fukui Karen,0,0,60,,Let's see. But somehow, having people there was reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.51,2:01:28.83,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.00,2:01:32.22,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,There were so many of us — seven of us today!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.30,2:01:33.20,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,Huh? That surprised me!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.56,2:01:34.48,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Seven!?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.56,2:01:37.48,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Seven of us, huh. That was reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.50,2:01:43.52,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,No, no — I wanted to match Shibu-chan, starting with my hairstyle,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.60,2:01:46.96,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,and liven things up, but
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.10,2:01:51.92,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,like this, with all of KIV joining forces,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.00,2:01:54.30,Default,Morisaki Saaya,0,0,60,,I think it turned into an even better Team H show.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.10,2:02:00.88,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,From now on too, we helpers want to keep livening things up!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.04,2:02:11.59,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,So, everyone — apparently today was someone's first time in a unit.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.67,2:02:12.63,Default,Tanaka Iori,0,0,60,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.17,2:02:15.43,Default,Member,0,0,60,,It was a first!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.77,2:02:18.59,Default,Yasui Hina,0,0,60,,Yes. My first time.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.33,2:02:19.67,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.16,2:02:24.22,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Everyone really supports us, so we get to do the Mokugekisha show,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:25.03,2:02:26.69,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,so please come again!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.81,2:02:27.31,Default,Multiple,0,0,60,,Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.75,2:02:28.09,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.26,2:02:31.77,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,And so, today's position —
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.85,2:02:32.85,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,today was my last time in it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.49,2:02:33.83,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.71,2:02:37.21,Default,Izawa Miyu,0,0,60,,The lines were the best.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.37,2:02:38.17,Default,Member,0,0,60,,Really, really.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.75,2:02:39.09,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.93,2:02:40.27,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,So —
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.97,2:02:46.57,Default,Kurihara Sae,0,0,60,,KIV shows, H shows, and the trainees too — everyone, please keep coming to see us!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.65,2:02:47.29,Default,All,0,0,60,,Thank you!
